Are you sure you want to add the plugin "{name}"?{Environment.NewLine}{Environment.NewLine}Please note,{Environment.NewLine}Plugins have full functionality permissions of a regular application, including reading/writing drafts, projects, and other local content, as well as executing code on the device and downloading data from servers.{Environment.NewLine}Be sure to only obtain plugins from trusted sources to avoid potential security risks.{Environment.NewLine}{Environment.NewLine}If you click OK, the application will trust the digital signature of this plugin, and all future updates for this plugin must use installation packages signed with the same certificate.{Environment.NewLine}{Environment.NewLine}Clicking OK also means you fully understand the risks of using the plugin and voluntarily assume related responsibilities.
